<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Tríptico Penal · Responsabilidad Civil Derivada | Capítulo VI</title>
<meta name="description" content="Análisis tridimensional —dogmática, ontología y hermenéutica— de los artículos 94 a 100 del Código Penal colombiano sobre responsabilidad civil derivada de la conducta punible.">

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,400;0,9..144,500;0,9..144,600;1,9..144,400&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<script>document.documentElement.classList.add('js');</script>

<style>
/* ============================================================
   TOKENS DE DISEÑO (Idénticos al Capítulo III para consistencia)
   ============================================================ */
:root{
  --bg:#f5f2ea; --surface:#fffdf7; --surface-2:#efeadd; --ink:#182430; --muted:#5d6874;
  --line:#d9d2c2; --gold:#9a7638; --gold-soft:#f0e6d2;
  --dogma:#2f5f8a; --dogma-soft:#e7eff7;
  --onto:#9a5a2c; --onto-soft:#f7ece0;
  --herme:#2b7267; --herme-soft:#e4f0ec;
  --shadow:0 18px 45px -25px rgba(24,36,48,.35); --radius:5px; --max:1240px; --header-h:76px;
}
html[data-theme="dark"]{
  --bg:#101820; --surface:#18222d; --surface-2:#1e2a36; --ink:#eae4d7; --muted:#a3aebb;
  --line:#31404f; --gold:#d3af68; --gold-soft:#2b2a20;
  --dogma:#8ab8e4; --dogma-soft:#1b2c3c; --onto:#d99b64; --onto-soft:#33271d; --herme:#7cc4b4; --herme-soft:#17302c;
  --shadow:0 18px 45px -25px rgba(0,0,0,.7);
}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:calc(var(--header-h) + 90px)}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;transition:background .35s,color .35s}
body::before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;opacity:.35;background-image:radial-gradient(var(--line) .6px,transparent .6px);background-size:22px 22px}
main,header,footer{position:relative;z-index:1}
h1,h2,h3,h4{font-family:'Fraunces',Georgia,serif;font-weight:500;line-height:1.15;margin:0}
p{margin:0 0 1em}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
button,input,select{font:inherit;color:inherit}
button{cursor:pointer}
ul,ol{margin:0 0 1em;padding-left:1.2em}
li{margin-bottom:.5em}
::selection{background:var(--gold);color:var(--bg)}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:4px;border-radius:2px}
.wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin-inline:auto;padding-inline:clamp(20px,5vw,60px)}
.mono{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace}
.eyebrow{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.19em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:22px}
.eyebrow .dot{width:7px;height:7px;background:var(--gold);border-radius:50%;flex:none}
section{padding-block:clamp(60px,8vw,110px)}
.section-head{max-width:760px;margin-bottom:48px}
.section-head h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.1rem);letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:18px}
.section-head p{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.05rem;max-width:66ch}
.skip{position:absolute;left:-9999px;top:0;background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg);padding:12px 20px;z-index:999}
.skip:focus{left:12px;top:12px}

/* Cabecera y Progreso */
.progress{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:3px;z-index:1002;background:transparent}
.progress span{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:var(--gold);transition:width .1s linear}
.site-header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1000;height:var(--header-h);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--bg) 88%,transparent);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.header-inner{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:32px}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex:none}
.brand-mark{width:38px;height:44px;border:1px solid var(--gold);display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--gold);border-radius:2px 2px 18px 18px}
.brand-name{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:1.22rem;line-height:1.1;display:block}
.brand-sub{display:block;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
.site-nav{display:flex;gap:26px;margin-left:auto}
.site-nav a{font-size:.82rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted);position:relative;padding-block:8px;transition:color .2s}
.site-nav a::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;width:0;height:2px;background:var(--gold);transition:width .25s}
.site-nav a:hover,.site-nav a.active{color:var(--ink)}
.site-nav a.active::after,.site-nav a:hover::after{width:100%}
.header-actions{display:flex;gap:8px}
.icon-btn{width:38px;height:38px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;transition:.2s;font-size:1rem}
.icon-btn:hover{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.icon-btn svg{width:17px;height:17px}

/* Hero */
.hero{padding-top:clamp(45px,6vw,80px);padding-bottom:0;overflow:hidden}
.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .85fr;gap:60px;align-items:center}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(3.2rem,7.5vw,6.4rem);letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:.98}
.hero h1 em{font-style:italic;color:var(--gold);display:block}
.lede{font-size:1.16rem;color:var(--muted);max-width:52ch;margin-top:26px}
.hero-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:26px 0 30px}
.chip{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:.66rem;letter-spacing:.06em;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--surface);color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:3px;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;transition:.25s;border:1px solid transparent}
.btn-primary{background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg)}
.btn-primary:hover{background:var(--gold);color:var(--bg);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.btn-ghost{border-color:var(--line);color:var(--ink)}
.btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold)}
.hero-cta{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hero-note{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:24px;max-width:48ch}
.hero-art{position:relative}
.hero-art svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}

/* Matriz */
.table-shell{overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--surface)}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:880px;font-size:.85rem}
thead{background:var(--surface-2)}
th{text-align:left;padding:18px 20px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:.64rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted)}
td{padding:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top;color:var(--muted)}
td:first-child{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}
td:first-child a{border-bottom:1px solid var(--gold);padding-bottom:2px}
tbody tr{transition:background .2s}
tbody tr:hover{background:var(--surface-2)}
th.c-dogma{color:var(--dogma)} th.c-onto{color:var(--onto)} th.c-herme{color:var(--herme)}

/* Barra de lectura */
.reader-bar{position:sticky;top:var(--header-h);z-index:900;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--bg) 94%,transparent);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-block:1px solid var(--line);padding-block:14px}
.reader-inner{display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.search-box{position:relative;flex:1;min-width:220px;max-width:340px}
.search-box svg{position:absolute;left:13px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:16px;height:16px;color:var(--muted)}
.search-box input{width:100%;padding:11px 36px 11px 38px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:3px;font-size:.83rem}
.search-box input:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--gold)}
.search-clear{position:absolute;right:8px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);border:0;background:none;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1;padding:4px}
.lenses{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.lens-btn{border:1px solid var(--line);background:transparent;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:999px;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:500;transition:.2s;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
.lens-btn i{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--c,var(--muted));font-style:normal}
.lens-btn:hover{border-color:var(--c,var(--gold))}
.lens-btn[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg);border-color:var(--ink)}
.reader-count{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:.66rem;color:var(--muted);margin-left:auto;white-space:nowrap}

/* Artículos / Tríptico */
#articulos{padding-top:50px}
.lexeme{padding-block:56px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);scroll-margin-top:160px}
.lexeme:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.lexeme-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:100px 1fr;gap:26px;align-items:start;margin-bottom:32px}
.lexeme-num{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:4.4rem;line-height:.9;color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1px var(--gold);letter-spacing:-.04em}
.lexeme-head h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.35rem);letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:12px}
.lexeme-origin{font-size:.76rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:14px}
.lexeme-tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px}
.lexeme-tags .chip{font-size:.62rem}

.dimensions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;align-items:start}
.dim{--c:var(--muted);--soft:var(--surface-2);background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:3px solid var(--c);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:26px 24px;position:relative;transition:box-shadow .3s,transform .3s,opacity .3s}
.dim:hover{box-shadow:var(--shadow);transform:translateY(-3px)}
.dim-dogmatica{--c:var(--dogma);--soft:var(--dogma-soft)}
.dim-ontologia{--c:var(--onto);--soft:var(--onto-soft)}
.dim-hermeneutica{--c:var(--herme);--soft:var(--herme-soft)}

.dim-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:20px}
.dim-icon{width:34px;height:34px;flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;background:var(--soft);color:var(--c);font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:1.15rem}
.dim-head h3{font-size:1.16rem;line-height:1.2}
.dim-head small{display:block;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:.58rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--c);margin-top:4px}
.dim h4{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:.63rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--c);margin:22px 0 10px;font-weight:500}
.dim p,.dim li{font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.8}
.dim p{color:var(--muted)}
.dim strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
.dim ul,.dim ol{color:var(--muted);padding-left:1.05em}
.dim li::marker{color:var(--c)}
.dim .pull{margin:20px 0 0;padding:16px 18px;background:var(--soft);border-left:2px solid var(--c);font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink)}
.dim .note{font-size:.76rem;padding:12px 14px;border:1px dashed var(--line);margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted)}
.dim .note b{color:var(--c);font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;display:block;margin-bottom:5px}
.kv{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:8px 14px;margin:16px 0 0;font-size:.8rem}
.kv dt{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--c);padding-top:3px}
.kv dd{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

body[data-lens="dogmatica"] .dim:not(.dim-dogmatica),
body[data-lens="ontologia"] .dim:not(.dim-ontologia),
body[data-lens="hermeneutica"] .dim:not(.dim-hermeneutica){display:none}
body:not([data-lens="all"]) .dimensions{grid-template-columns:1fr;max-width:860px}
body:not([data-lens="all"]) .dim{padding:34px}
body:not([data-lens="all"]) .dim p,body:not([data-lens="all"]) .dim li{font-size:.98rem}

.norm{margin-top:24px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--surface-2);overflow:hidden}
.norm summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:17px 22px;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;transition:background .2s}
.norm summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.norm summary:hover{background:var(--surface)}
.norm summary .plus{margin-left:auto;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--gold);transition:transform .3s}
.norm[open] summary .plus{transform:rotate(45deg)}
.norm summary .tag{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--muted);font-weight:400}
.norm-body{padding:8px 26px 26px;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.85;color:var(--muted);border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.norm-body h5{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:.66rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink);margin:22px 0 10px}
.norm-body ol,.norm-body ul{padding-left:1.4em}
.norm-body p{margin-bottom:.9em}

.connections{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:22px}
.connections .label{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-right:6px}
.link-chip{font-size:.72rem;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:5px 11px;border-radius:3px;transition:.2s;background:var(--surface)}
.link-chip:hover{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold)}
.copy-btn{margin-left:auto;font-size:.7rem;background:none;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:5px 11px;border-radius:3px;color:var(--muted);transition:.2s}
.copy-btn:hover{color:var(--gold);border-color:var(--gold)}
.empty{display:none;padding:60px 20px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius)}
.empty.show{display:block}
.empty b{display:block;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px}

/* Tensiones */
.tension{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);margin-bottom:14px;background:var(--surface);overflow:hidden}
.tension summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;padding:22px 26px;display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:1.12rem;transition:background .2s}
.tension summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.tension summary:hover{background:var(--surface-2)}
.tension summary .n{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:.68rem;color:var(--gold);flex:none}
.tension summary .plus{margin-left:auto;color:var(--gold);transition:transform .3s;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif}
.tension[open] summary .plus{transform:rotate(45deg)}
.tension-body{padding:0 26px 26px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px}
.tension-body h5{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--gold)}
.tension-body p{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);margin:0}
.tension-body > div:last-child{border-left:1px solid var(--line);padding-left:24px}

/* Footer y utilidades */
.site-footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-block:36px;background:var(--surface)}
.footer-inner{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.footer-inner p{margin:0;font-size:.76rem;color:var(--muted)}
.footer-inner .mono{font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}
.to-top{position:fixed;bottom:26px;right:26px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg);border:0;display:grid;place-items:center;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transform:translateY(12px);transition:.3s;z-index:950}
.to-top.show{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto;transform:none}
.to-top:hover{background:var(--gold)}
.toast{position:fixed;bottom:30px;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,20px);background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg);padding:13px 24px;border-radius:4px;font-size:.82rem;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:.3s;z-index:1100}
.toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0)}

.js .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px);transition:opacity .7s ease,transform .7s ease}
.js .reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
@media (max-width:1080px){
  .site-nav{display:none}
  .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}
  .hero-art{max-width:360px;margin-inline:auto;order:-1}
  .dimensions{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .tension-body{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}
  .tension-body > div:last-child{border-left:0;padding-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:20px}
}
@media (max-width:760px){
  :root{--header-h:66px}
  .header-inner{gap:12px}
  .brand-name{font-size:1.05rem}
  .hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.8rem,13vw,4rem)}
  .reader-inner{gap:12px}
  .search-box{max-width:none;flex-basis:100%}
  .reader-count{margin-left:0}
  .lexeme-head{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px}
  .lexeme-num{font-size:3rem}
  .copy-btn{margin-left:0}
  .footer-inner{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}
}
@media print{
  :root{--bg:#fff;--surface:#fff;--ink:#111;--muted:#333;--line:#bbb}
  body{font-size:11pt;background:#fff}
  body::before,.site-header,.reader-bar,.progress,.to-top,.toast,.hero-cta,.hero-art,.copy-btn,.header-actions{display:none!important}
  .wrap{max-width:none;padding:0}
  section{padding-block:20px;break-inside:avoid}
  .dimensions{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}
  .dim{break-inside:avoid;box-shadow:none}
  .lexeme{break-before:page}
  .lexeme:first-child{break-before:auto}
  .reveal{opacity:1!important;transform:none!important}
}
</style>
</head>

<body data-lens="all">
<a class="skip" href="#contenido">Saltar al contenido principal</a>
<div class="progress" aria-hidden="true"><span id="progressBar"></span></div>

<header class="site-header">
  <div class="wrap header-inner">
    <a href="#inicio" class="brand" aria-label="Tríptico Penal, inicio">
      <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">§</span>
      <span>
        <span class="brand-name">Tríptico Penal</span>
        <span class="brand-sub">Dogmática · Ontología · Hermenéutica</span>
      </span>
    </a>
    <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Navegación principal">
      <a href="#mapa">Matriz</a>
      <a href="#articulos">Artículos</a>
      <a href="#tensiones">Tensiones</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="header-actions">
      <button class="icon-btn" id="themeToggle" aria-label="Cambiar tema" title="Cambiar tema">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12.8A9 9 0 1 1 11.2 3a7 7 0 0 0 9.8 9.8Z"/></svg>
      </button>
      <button class="icon-btn" id="printBtn" aria-label="Imprimir" title="Imprimir">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9V3h12v6M6 18H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"/><path d="M6 14h12v8H6z"/></svg>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="contenido">

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero" id="inicio">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> Código Penal colombiano · Ley 599 de 2000</p>
        <h1>La deuda <em>con la víctima.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Una lectura tridimensional del <strong>Capítulo Sexto: De la Responsabilidad Civil Derivada de la Conducta Punible</strong>. 
          Cuando el delito hiere, el derecho no solo castiga: intenta, a través de la reparación, suturar el mundo roto.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-meta">
          <span class="chip">CAPÍTULO SEXTO</span>
          <span class="chip">ARTS. 94 — 100</span>
          <span class="chip">REPARACIÓN · COMISO · PRESCRIPCIÓN</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a href="#articulos" class="btn btn-primary">Explorar los artículos</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 440 380" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <rect x="16" y="16" width="408" height="348" rx="3" fill="none" stroke="var(--line)"/>
          <text x="220" y="48" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--muted)" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-size="9" letter-spacing="4">RESPONSABILIDAD CIVIL</text>
          
